orld positions; do not continue their motion.\",\n  \"motion\": \"Within EACH segment use smoothstep easing: accelerate from zero speed and decelerate to zero at the next keyframe. Pass through the keyframe without an extra dwell or cut. Angular and radius offsets ease together; interpolate within each pair of endpoints without overshoot.\",\n  \"parallax\": \"Reveal the same scene consistently through physical camera motion. Let perspective and occlusion follow the scene geometry; no prescribed screen-space background displacement.\",\n  \"segments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S1\",\n      \"start_s\": 0.0,\n      \"end_s\": 5.125,\n      \"camera_mode\": \"physically move the CAMERA 113.000 degrees around the fixed target toward the camera's RIGHT, keeping the lens aimed at that target; the subject itself stays stationary; simultaneously physically LOWER the CAMERA along a vertical arc around the fixed target, revealing a lower viewpoint; keep aiming at the target; simultaneously decrease elevation offset from 0.000 to -5.000 degrees relative to the reference camera; simultaneously pull back from radius 1.000 to 1.860 times the reference radius\",\n      \"camera_travel\": \"right\",\n      \"signed_orbit_degrees\": 113.0,\n      \"speed_curve\": \"smoothstep\",\n      \"start\": {\n        \"azimuth\": 0.0,\n        \"elevation\": 0.0,\n        \"distance\": 1.0\n      },\n      \"end\": {\n        \"azimuth\": 113.0,\n        \"elevation\": -5.0,\n        \"distance\": 1.86\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"final\": \"Reach the final pose at 5.125000s; there is no additional hold.\",\n  \"forbid\": \"No cuts, subject rotation, subject animation, digital zoom, lighting changes, or visible planning annotations.\",\n  \"instruction\": \"Preserve the source scene.\",\n  \"sound\": \"Silence.\",\n  \"coordinate_anchor\": {\n    \"kind\": \"reference_image\",\n    \"box\": \"[L=0.000, T=0.000, W=1.000, H=1.000]\",\n    \"instruction\": \"The complete reference image occupies